			"Message": "build(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration files and rebuild targets\n\nExpand ESBuild configuration files from minified to formatted output\nfor improved readability. The formatting changes affect:\n\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js - Expanded multi-line format\n- Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js - Expanded multi-line format\n- Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js - Minor line break adjustments\n\nRebuilt all target files to reflect configuration changes:\n- Target/Worker.js\n- Target/Worker/CSS/Load.js\n- Target/Worker/Policy.js\n- Target/Worker/Register.js\n\nNo functional changes, purely formatting and rebuild.",
